<title>USA: Presstek to report results within 2 wks.</title>
<headline>Presstek to report results within 2 wks.</headline>
<dateline>HUDSON, N.H. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Presstek Inc said on Tuesday it will report year-end results within two weeks, and responded to investor inquiries by saying its business is &quot;on track.&quot;</p>
<p>Presstek's shares fell from 60-1/2 to as low as 52 in Nasdaq trading Tuesday, but had climbed back to 55 by mid-afternoon.</p>
